[32m│[0m [4;35m1  Scope and Purpose[0m                                                                                                 [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m This specification defines the mandatory incoming inspection, electrical acceptance tests, and LED                   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m chromaticity/photometric tests required to validate every production unit of the MDIO-INPUT1 PCB assembly prior to   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m shipment or integration into end systems.                                                                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m The MDIO-INPUT1 is a 16-channel, 24 V DC digital input module intended for use in industrial automation and          [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m process-control environments. Its primary function is to receive field-side digital signals in the 24 V range,       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m provide galvanic isolation via quad optocouplers, and report the logic states over a standard I²C bus using a        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m PCF8575 16bit port expander. Two physical I²C connection options (pin header and flat cable/IDC) are provided.       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m All tests documented herein apply to Class 2 performance per IPC-A-610 unless otherwise stated. Tests are mandatory  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m and must be completed in the sequence given. A unit that fails any test is quarantined and dispositioned before it   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m may proceed to subsequent tests.                                                                                     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m                                                                                                                      [32m│[0m
