[2;36m                    [0m         [32mintegration into end systems.\n\nThe MDIO-IN[0m[1;33mPUT[0m[32m1 is a 16-channel, 24 V DC digital input [0m   
[2;36m                    [0m         [32mmodule intended for use in industrial automation and process-control environments. Its [0m    
[2;36m                    [0m         [32mprimary function is to receive field-side digital signals in the 24 V range, provide [0m      
