[2;36m                    [0m         [32mbus using a PCF8575 16bit port expander. Two physical I²C connection options [0m[32m([0m[32mpin header [0m  
[2;36m                    [0m         [32mand flat cable/IDC[0m[32m)[0m[32m are provided.\n\nAll tests documented herein apply to Class 2 [0m         
